          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "SUMMARY"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.157,
            0.652,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Percentages are widely used in our daily life."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.188,
            0.822,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Percentages are fractions with denominator 100. Percentages are denoted using the symbol ʻ%ʼ, pronounced ʻper centʼ. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "X ^ { 0 } \\% = { \\frac { X } { 1 0 0 } } \\cdot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.242,
            0.485,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fractions can be converted to percentages and vice versa. Decimals too can be converted to percentages and vice versa. For example, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{4}{10} = 0.4 = 40\\%."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.499,
            0.257,
            0.821,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.499,
                0.257,
                0.821,
                0.33
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_30_table_6.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.605,
            0.327,
            0.682,
            0.353
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_30_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac { 4 0 } { 1 0 0 } = 0 . 4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.37,
            0.821,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have learnt to find the exact number when a certain percentage of the total quantity is given."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.418,
            0.821,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When parts of a quantity are given to us as ratios, we have seen how to convert them to percentages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.466,
            0.822,
            0.507
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The increase or decrease in a certain quantity can also be expressed as a percentage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.514,
            0.821,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The profits or losses incurred in transactions, and tax rates, can be expressed in terms of percentages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.562,
            0.823,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have seen how a quantity or a number grows when compounded. Interest rates are a common example of compounding. If p is the principal, r is the rate of interest, and t is the number of terms, then the total amount after the maturity period is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.803,
            0.822,
            0.863
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A situation or a problem can often be solved by describing it using a rough diagram. We have learnt to estimate and do mental computations to solve problems related to percentages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
